---
interface Props{kind:'rules'|'search'|'bayes'}
const {kind}=Astro.props,id='reason-'+kind,arrow=`url(#${id}-arrow)`;
const titles={rules:'Separate what is allowed from what is preferred.',search:'Fewest actions does not mean lowest cost.',bayes:'Evidence updates a hidden belief, then a prediction.'};
const captions={rules:'Figure 1. Trusted catalog facts support explicit eligibility checks. Only feasible films enter the decision. A probability estimates enjoyment; utility expresses the value of watching.',search:'Figure 2. The direct edge costs 10. The three-step route costs 3. A detour cycles back to Start. Numbers beside edges are costs; h is estimated remaining cost. Every arrow is directed.',bayes:'Figure 3. For a fixed movie, the model factors as P(H) × P(E | H) × P(J | H). E is trailer feedback, H is mood, and J is enjoyment. The update runs from observed feedback to the hidden mood; arrows specify the probability model, not proof of causation.'};
---
<figure class="diagram"><div class="figure-title"><span class="figure-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>{titles[kind]}</div><div class="diagram-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={titles[kind]}><svg viewBox="0 0 760 280" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-title ${id}-desc`}><title id={`${id}-title`}>{titles[kind]}</title><desc id={`${id}-desc`}>{captions[kind]}</desc><defs><marker id={`${id}-arrow`} markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8Z" fill="var(--accent)"/></marker></defs>
{kind==='rules'&&<>{[['Facts','95 min · downloaded'],['Rules','Fits time + offline'],['Feasible set','Quiet Orbit + Lane'],['Decision','Probability + utility']].map(([title,sub],i)=><g><rect x={18+i*188} y="55" width="160" height="88" rx="8" fill={i===2?'var(--accent-soft)':'var(--panel)'} stroke="var(--line)"/><text x={98+i*188} y="90" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="15">{title}</text><text x={98+i*188} y="118" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="12">{sub}</text>{i<3&&<path d={`M${181+i*188} 100 H${199+i*188}`} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={arrow}/>}</g>)}<text x="380" y="198" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">A high enjoyment score cannot override an offline constraint.</text><text x="380" y="238" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">No feasible film → explain the limit. No worthwhile film → consider skipping.</text></>}
{kind==='search'&&<>
<path d="M80 93 V25 H677 V93" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={arrow}/><text x="380" y="19" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="13">Bundled preparation · cost 10</text>
{[{x:20,y:96,name:'Start',h:3},{x:220,y:96,name:'Check',h:2},{x:420,y:96,name:'Pick',h:1},{x:617,y:96,name:'Ready',h:0},{x:220,y:207,name:'Detour',h:4}].map(n=><g><rect x={n.x} y={n.y} width="120" height="55" rx="8" fill={n.name==='Ready'?'var(--accent-soft)':'var(--panel)'} stroke="var(--line)"/><text x={n.x+60} y={n.y+24} text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="15">{n.name}</text><text x={n.x+60} y={n.y+44} text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="12">{`h = ${n.h}`}</text></g>)}
{[140,340,540].map(x=><g><path d={`M${x+3} 123 H${x+75}`} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={arrow}/><text x={x+40} y="111" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="13">1</text></g>)}
<path d="M100 155 L218 219" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={arrow}/><text x="173" y="181" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="13">1</text><path d="M217 245 H80 V156" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end={arrow}/><text x="115" y="239" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="13">1</text><text x="537" y="216" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="15">BFS: 1 edge, cost 10</text><text x="537" y="245" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="15">UCS / A*: 3 edges, cost 3</text>
</>}
{kind==='bayes'&&<>
<rect x="270" y="20" width="220" height="65" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="380" y="47" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">H · Sci-fi mood</text><text x="380" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Hidden · prior 50%</text>
<path d="M325 89 L185 147" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={arrow}/><path d="M435 89 L575 147" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={arrow}/>
<rect x="55" y="152" width="260" height="65" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="185" y="179" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">E · Trailer feedback</text><text x="185" y="202" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Observed: liked</text>
<rect x="445" y="152" width="260" height="65" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="575" y="179" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">J · Movie enjoyment</text><text x="575" y="202" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Unobserved: predict it</text>
<text x="380" y="261" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="15">Liked trailer → P(H | E) = 80% → P(enjoy Quiet Orbit | E) = 78%</text>
</>}
</svg></div><figcaption>{captions[kind]}</figcaption></figure>
